[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1856274212","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213#issuecomment-1856274212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213","id":1856274212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85upH8k","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-12-14T17:29:56Z","updated_at":"2023-12-14T17:29:56Z","body":"Discussed briefly on 2023-12-14 legal team call, @swinslow to review in detail and provide full analysis for consideration","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1856274212/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1856283096","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213#issuecomment-1856283096","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213","id":1856283096,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85upKHY","user":{"login":"jcfr","id":219043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr","html_url":"https://github.com/jcfr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-12-14T17:35:11Z","updated_at":"2023-12-14T17:35:11Z","body":"Thanks for follow-up :pray: \r\n\r\nIn the meantime, let us know if you you have any questions.\r\n\r\ncc: @lassoan @pieper @sjh26","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1856283096/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1946782747","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213#issuecomment-1946782747","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213","id":1946782747,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE850CYwb","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-15T17:58:27Z","updated_at":"2024-02-15T18:01:04Z","body":"# New submission review\r\n\r\n* **Has the license been approved by the OSI?** \r\n    - [ ] Yes\r\n    - [X] No - it was submitted to OSI, some issues raised, and then submission was rescinded\r\n\r\n## Definitive Factors\r\n\r\n_These must all be satisfied to allow inclusion in the license list_\r\n\r\n1. **Is the submitted license unique, that is, it does not match another license already on the License List as per the [matching guidelines](https://spdx.org/spdx-license-list/matching-guidelines)?**\r\n    - [x] Yes\r\n    - [ ] No\r\n1. **If a software license, does it apply to source code and not only to executables?**\r\n    - [x] Yes\r\n    - [ ] No\r\n1. **Does the license have identifiable and stable text, and is not in the midst of drafting?**\r\n    - [x] Yes\r\n    - [ ] No\r\n1. **Has the license steward, if any, committed to versioning new versions and to not modify it after addition to the list?**\r\n    - I believe so\r\n\r\n## Other factors for inclusion\r\n\r\n*Roughly in order of descending importance*\r\n\r\n1. **Does the license substantially comply with one of the free/open content definitions? (examples include the [Open Source Definition](https://opensource.org/osd) and the [Debian Free Software Guidelines](https://www.debian.org/social_contract#guidelines))** \r\n    - the license part B seems to, but it also includes in part A a contributor license, which is simply unusual\r\n1. **Is the license structured to be generally usable by anyone, and not specific to one organisation or project?**\r\n    - [ ] Yes\r\n    - [X] No - it is very much specific to the project and project maintainer\r\n1. **Does the license have substantial use such that it is likely to be encountered (ie. use in many projects, or in one significant project)?** \r\n    - given it is specific to a project, functionality, and project maintainer, it won't be used or found in other projects. That being said, according to the Slicer website, it has been downloaded a million times, see https://slicer.readthedocs.io/en/latest/user_guide/about.html#historical-notes-about-the-license so we might consider that substantially use in and of itself?\r\n1. **Is the license primarily intended to facilitate the free distribution of content with limited restrictions?**\r\n    - Yes, but it is very, very specific to the code, type of code (has clauses related to medical software), and project maintainers\r\n1. **Does the license steward support this submission, or is at least aware of and not in opposition of it?**\r\n    - I believe so\r\n## Summary of factors, outcome, comments\r\n\r\nAlthough I'm a bit stuck on the specificity of the license and that it's been around for some time (since 2005) and no one has yet submitted it (I've never come across it myself, but that's just me). At the same time, if the download history can be considered significant and it is likely to be found in the software supply chain, then I'd think it is viable to add. I'm just not clear on this last part.\r\nI'd like to get some other thoughts from the SPDX-legal community","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1946782747/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1946857416","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213#issuecomment-1946857416","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213","id":1946857416,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE850Cq_I","user":{"login":"pieper","id":126077,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjA3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126077?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pieper","html_url":"https://github.com/pieper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pieper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pieper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pieper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pieper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pieper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pieper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pieper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pieper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pieper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-15T18:22:07Z","updated_at":"2024-02-15T18:22:07Z","body":"Thank you for the review.  Let us know if there are any specifics we can help resolve.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1946857416/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1962095748","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213#issuecomment-1962095748","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213","id":1962095748,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8508zSE","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-23T22:42:30Z","updated_at":"2024-02-23T22:48:00Z","body":"**ScanCode** \r\nidentifier: [3dslicer-1.0](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/3dslicer-1.0.LICENSE)\r\n\r\n**metaeffekt universe** \r\ncanonical name: [3D Slicer Contribution and Software License Agreement 1.0](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/%5B3%5D/%5B3d%5D/3D-Slicer-Contribution-and-Software-License-Agreement-1.0.yaml)\r\nshort identifier: 3D-Slicer-1.0 (we preserve original case)\r\n\r\n**Others:**\r\nI would not include the \"-license\" on the short name. This is until now done very rarely (some exceptional BSD cases). The predominant convention - as it appears to me - is not to include a \"-license\" suffix on shortId.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1962095748/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1962134992","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213#issuecomment-1962134992","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213","id":1962134992,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE850883Q","user":{"login":"jcfr","id":219043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr","html_url":"https://github.com/jcfr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-23T23:31:53Z","updated_at":"2024-02-23T23:31:53Z","body":"Thanks for taking the time to comment and provide references :pray: \r\n\r\nBeing consistent with existing best practices and conventions makes sense. I definitely support the proposed naming :ok_hand: \r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nExplicitly specifying `1.0` is indeed sensible considering the version is explicitly mentioned in the license text :100: \r\n\r\n<img width=50% src=\"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/assets/219043/6f5cead3-d9d2-4c94-bb06-689a52cd49ba\"/>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1962134992/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1965149916","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213#issuecomment-1965149916","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213","id":1965149916,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE851Ic7c","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-26T20:00:40Z","updated_at":"2024-02-26T20:00:40Z","body":"Thanks @karsten-klein  for the input on naming!\r\n\r\nDo you have any insight as to the \"substantial use\" factor? (see my comment above)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1965149916/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1965873891","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213#issuecomment-1965873891","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213","id":1965873891,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE851LNrj","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-27T06:30:59Z","updated_at":"2024-02-27T06:30:59Z","body":"I'm afraid, I don't have any substantial information on the use of the license.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1965873891/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2020635405","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213#issuecomment-2020635405","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213","id":2020635405,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE854cHMN","user":{"login":"jcfr","id":219043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr","html_url":"https://github.com/jcfr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcfr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-26T14:46:47Z","updated_at":"2024-03-26T14:49:42Z","body":"> Do you have any insight as to the \"substantial use\" factor?\r\n\r\nOver the past decade, the project has been downloaded more than 1.5 million times[^1], with over 270,000 downloads in just the past year alone. Moreover, Slicer was used in more than 17,000 peer reviewed publications[^2]. Beyond its academic and research applications, the software also serves as the foundation for various commercial applications, including FDA-approved ones[^3].\r\n\r\nIt may also be worth noting that the license was developed by Harvard Medical School in the context of collaborative NIH-funded research involving 15 institutions, including MIT, GE, UNC, and other commercial and academic organizations. All parties involved carefully reviewed and signed off on the license. Subsequent reviews by other organizations have supported ongoing growth of the community.\r\n\r\nThanks again for your time reviewing our submission :pray:.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, let us know if you have any additional questions. Also, if you think that would be helpful, we have a weekly[^4] public video hangout with users and developers of the medical imaging community and we would welcome the opportunity to engage further in discussions there.\r\n\r\n_Reply co-authored by @pieper, @lassoan and @jcfr in the context of the Slicer weekly community meeting of March 26th._\r\n\r\n[^1]: https://download.slicer.org/download-stats/\r\n[^2]: https://scholar.google.com/scholar?hl=en&as_sdt=1%2C22&as_vis=1&q=%28%223D+Slicer%22+OR+%22slicer+software%22+OR+%22slicer+org%22+OR+Slicer3D%29+-Slic3r+&btnG=\r\n[^3]: https://www.slicer.org/commercial-use.html\r\n[^4]: Weekly at 10am ET, announced at https://discourse.slicer.org/c/community/hangout/20","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2020635405/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2103028050","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213#issuecomment-2103028050","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2213","id":2103028050,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE859WalS","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organi